•	Aggregate functions: SUM, COUNT, AVG
•	CASE expressions
•	FILTER for conditional aggregation
•	ROUND and decimal percentage calculations
•	DATE_TRUNC, EXTRACT and TO_CHAR for time analysis
•	Common Table Expressions (CTEs)
•	Subqueries
•	Views
•	Top-N analysis and ranking
•	Distinct customer analysis
•	Power BI-ready analytical datasets

